                                "sense_id": "6429b805-9b18-3c3f-8958-f1b92edf830b",
                                "text": "And then to the Trin'de on the chutes, in the lightmans / The Bube & Ruffian cly the Harman beck & harmans."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a56286f4-9ab6-4ed3-81a7-1c0694f52b2b",
                                "sense_id": "6429b805-9b18-3c3f-8958-f1b92edf830b",
                                "text": "Why, you would not be boosing till lightman's in a square crib like mine, as if you were in a flash panny?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "447495c2-8855-4ea7-a21f-984f172c13a9",
                                "sense_id": "6429b805-9b18-3c3f-8958-f1b92edf830b",
                                "text": "Mr. Kestrel's out to dinner with some of his pals, and he 'most never comes home till lightmans."
